# Bot2 exiles the Courtier with Swords to Plowshares in response to its enters trigger, so on resolution there is nothing to
# attach the Role to and none is created (CR 303.4g). The Courtier was still the printed 3/3 when Swords resolved, so Bot1 gains 3
# life (the Role would have made it a 1/1).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Cursed Courtier
Plains x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Swords to Plowshares
Plains x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Cursed Courtier.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Cursed Courtier)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Exile = Cursed Courtier
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 23
Bot1.Battlefield =
Bot2.Graveyard = Swords to Plowshares
